## Symptom

The B294 register guard holds while the connector is alive-but-permanently-failing: connector_owns_alias (c2c_relay_connector.ml:1693-1707) accepts pid-alive regardless of last_ok age. With a register arm failing every pass (identity binding drift after a rename), the root cycles wedge cooldowns while the documented repair (CLI relay register) is refused with pid alive - the operator must know to stop the connector first.

## Fix direction

Demote pid-alive below last_ok-fresh when the recorded last_error_op is register.

## Evidence

Connector review 2026-09-17.